{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <i>Herogue</i>! Customize the perfect team and forge your way to victory in this turn-based, roguelike battler!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Features</strong>: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>One-of-a-kind mechanics</i></strong>: Each character has their own unique mechanics. Customize the fighting style that's best for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Upgrades</i></strong>: Use EXP coins to upgrade characters. Choose from an array of enhancement paths, allowing you to cultivate multiple styles for the same character. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067270/extras/LevelUp.gif?t=1743790618\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Build a Team</strong></i>: Based on your strategy and likes, customize your team whenever you see fit. Who knows how a few tweaks will affect the whole team? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067270/extras/Select_Team.gif?t=1743790618\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can build a Poison-focused strategy, eliminating all enemies through poison effects.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067270/extras/Poision_.gif?t=1743790618\" /><br><br>Or go for a Power build, stacking buffs to unleash devastating bursts of damage.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067270/extras/Power.gif?t=1743790618\" /><br><br>Or perhaps a Thorns strategy, relying on counterattacks to handle every threat.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067270/extras/Spike.gif?t=1743790618\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Tons of Statuses &amp; Buffs</strong></i>: With tons of buffs, debuffs, and statuses floating around, they may be the key to victory...or defeat! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067270/extras/Gif2_AdobeExpress.gif?t=1743790618\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Tag Team Mechanics</i></strong>: Deploy teammates from the sidelines to swap positions with characters currently in battle. Switch up the formation and turn the tides of victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067270/extras/Gif4_AdobeExpress.gif?t=1743790618\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Not to mention all the other combinations and formations just waiting to be discovered!</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Hey There, Noob!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2067270/c9d99ec1d2cd88838ec239e7c3624711e86ad690.jpg"},{"name":"Samsara","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2067270/4156b85a146b505f4da2cdae5d46454a19035ffa.jpg"},{"name":"Error, Error","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2067270/d659cc1270073e3d0f985201f6b676b6fb4c3dfa.jpg"},{"name":"This City is Ours","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2067270/3777909905eedca1a9880893d0c05e92e695e419.jpg"},{"name":"Heavy Metal Overload","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2067270/eb153161576824fd73b3f985589ff19e471df0d9.jpg"},{"name":