 Each character has their own unique mechanics. Customize the fighting style that's best for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Upgrades</i></strong>: Use EXP coins to upgrade characters. Choose from an array of enhancement paths, allowing you to cultivate multiple styles for the same character. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067270/extras/LevelUp.gif?t=1743790618\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Build a Team</strong></i>: Based on your strategy and likes, customize your team whenever you see fit. Who knows how a few tweaks will affect the whole team? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067270/extras/Select_Team.gif?t=1743790618\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can build a Poison-focused strategy, eliminating all enemies through poison effects.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067270/extras/Poision_.gif?t=1743790618\" /><br><br>Or go for a Power build, stacking buffs to unleash devastating bursts of damage.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067270/extras/Power.gif?t=1743790618\" /><br><br>Or perhaps a Thorns strategy, relying on counterattacks to handle every threat.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067270/extras/Spike.gif?t=1743790618\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Tons of Statuses &amp; Buffs</strong></i>: With tons of buffs, debuffs, and statuses floating around, they may be the key to victory...or defeat! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067270/extras/Gif2_AdobeExpress.gif?t=1743790618\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Tag Team Mechanics</i></strong>: Deploy teammates from the sidelines to swap positions with characters currently in battle. Switch up the formation and turn the tides of victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067270/extras/Gif4_AdobeExpress.gif?t=1743790618\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Not to mention all the other combinations and formations just waiting to be discovered!</i></p>","developers":["\u5df4\u8c46\u80a5\u5de5\u4f5c\u5ba4"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067270/header.jpg?t=1743790618","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257060319,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257060319/movie480.mp4?t=1727699022","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257060319/movie_max.mp4?t=1727699022"},"name":"Herogue Demo","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257060319/ecf78f386b9e2a52a9371aba15730775151b2270/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1727699022","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257060319/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1727699022","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_traile